[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8342.389, "timestamp": "02:19:02", "text": "这是一个非常搞笑的故事。嗯，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8344.79, "timestamp": "02:19:04", "text": "问题是，在我生日那天，我好像不在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8347.03, "timestamp": "02:19:07", "text": "真的会为我的生日做些什么吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8349.349, "timestamp": "02:19:09", "text": "呃，我的俱乐部成员们，他们就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8351.349, "timestamp": "02:19:11", "text": "嘿，他们发现那是我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8354.23, "timestamp": "02:19:14", "text": "生日那天，呃，还有个庆祝活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8357.03, "timestamp": "02:19:17", "text": "在另一所大学里，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8358.95, "timestamp": "02:19:18", "text": "受邀前往。所以他们带走了我们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8362.549, "timestamp": "02:19:22", "text": "那里，呃呃，他们，他们，他们喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8365.429, "timestamp": "02:19:25", "text": "带我逛了逛节日现场。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8368.23, "timestamp": "02:19:28", "text": "他偷了一束花送给我。嗯，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8370.709, "timestamp": "02:19:30", "text": "差点偷了一束花送给我。呃，在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8373.27, "timestamp": "02:19:33", "text": "最后，他们送了我一个红色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8374.95, "timestamp": "02:19:34", "text": "罗斯，我当时就想，“我的天哪，这是哪儿？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8376.629, "timestamp": "02:19:36", "text": "你们是从哪里弄到这个的？他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8379.669, "timestamp": "02:19:39", "text": "比如，“哦，我们找到了一束花”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8382.23, "timestamp": "02:19:42", "text": "就像躺在长椅上一样。”他们就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8384.23, "timestamp": "02:19:44", "text": "讨论是否直接偷走全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8386.23, "timestamp": "02:19:46", "text": "但他们最终只买了一束花。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8388.87, "timestamp": "02:19:48", "text": "玫瑰。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8391.11, "timestamp": "02:19:51", "text": "然后，然后他们带我出去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8393.429, "timestamp": "02:19:53", "text": "像这样喝印度奶茶很受欢迎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8395.03, "timestamp": "02:19:55", "text": "点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8397.83, "timestamp": "02:19:57", "text": "我的生日就是这样过的。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8399.59, "timestamp": "02:19:59", "text": "很棒。"}]